We have structure file path: /results/10_feb_melting/gpt_oss/react/surface_energy/subtask/level_1/brief/aluminum_surface_1_subtask_structure_retrieval_trial_1/aluminum.data

Potential file: /potentials/EAM/Al99.eam.alloy

We need to replicate unit cell 5x5x5, then remove periodic boundary along direction [0,0,1] i.e., z. So we need to create a slab with vacuum? Usually we set boundary p p f (non-periodic in z). Then perform minimization with given parameters.

We need to generate LAMMPS input script, run LAMMPS, then get final energy from log. Use run_lammps tool.

First, we need to know potential metadata: use get_potential_metadata.
